Welcome to this week's Top 7, where the DEV editorial team handpicks their favorite posts from the previous week. Congrats to all the authors that made it onto the list 👏 Nobody Writes Clean Code. We All Just Pretend Sylwia Laskowska ・ Dec 1 #webdev #programming #productivity #discuss
@sylwia-lask challenges the myth of perfect codebases, arguing that messy production code is a shared reality rather than a personal failure. The author advocates for writing "survivable" code and prioritizing kindness to oneself over perfectionism. Other languages than English in code david duymelinck ・ Dec 3 #discuss
